{"id":"653933","name":"黄瓜拌鱿鱼圈","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/653933/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"一块"},{"name":"鱿鱼圈","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"海参","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"一个大黄瓜，取可一块，小黄瓜的话总一根。","img":"images/653933/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜切片，大蒜切末。","img":"images/653933/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放一起。","img":"images/653933/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取鱿鱼圈和海参。","img":"images/653933/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧开水。","img":"images/653933/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放海鲜。","img":"images/653933/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮开锅即可。","img":"images/653933/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"过冷水。","img":"images/653933/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鱿鱼去皮洗净改刀。","img":"images/653933/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"所有食材放一起，放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/653933/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放鸭梨醋。","img":"images/653933/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/653933/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653933/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}